---
// AboutFounder.astro
// Layout (desktop ≥900px):
//   ROW 1: [paragraphs — 55%] [photo placeholder — 45%]
//   ROW 2: [paragraphs continue] [quote card — 45%]
//   ROW 3: [4 process cards — full 1440px, 4-col]
//   ROW 4: [partner strip — full width]
//
// Mobile: all blocks stack in reading order:
//   header → paragraphs → photo → quote → cards → strip
---

<section class="founder-section" id="about" aria-labelledby="founder-heading">
  <div class="founder-inner">

    <!-- ══ TOP SECTION: paragraphs + photo + quote ══ -->
    <div class="founder-top">

      <!-- LEFT: section tag + headline + all paragraphs -->
      <div class="founder-left reveal">

        <div class="section-tag">
          <div class="tag-line"></div>
          <span>The Founding</span>
        </div>

        <h2 class="section-headline" id="founder-heading">
          Built from the <span class="accent">Ground Up</span>
        </h2>

        <p class="section-lead">
          In 1987, K.&thinsp;R. Subramanian established Jayveecons, Consultants and Engineers
          in Bengaluru as a process engineering consultancy focused on Vertical Shaft Kiln
          technology for small-scale cement plants. What began as a specialised advisory
          practice quickly evolved into something far more significant.
        </p>
        <p class="section-lead">
          The strength of those early engagements — and the trust earned through them —
          expanded our footprint across industries including mining, food processing, steel,
          and waste management. As client requirements became more complex and
          execution-driven, it became clear that consultancy alone would not deliver
          comprehensive solutions to our customers' needs. This was our natural catalyst
          to build.
        </p>
        <p class="section-lead">
          Over the past three decades, our greatest asset has been the feedback and trust of
          our customers. Every machine we design carries with it the lessons of real-world
          operation — refined through performance, iteration, and accountability in the field.
          This continuous feedback loop has shaped our engineering philosophy and remains the
          foundation of our growth.
        </p>
        <p class="section-lead">
          Today, that experience is embedded into how we design the future. Through platforms
          like <strong>VECTRIX™</strong>, we are formalizing decades of practical knowledge
          into predictive engineering systems — enabling faster innovation, greater accuracy,
          and smarter equipment design.
        </p>
        <p class="section-lead">
          As we look ahead, our focus remains clear: to build the next generation of
          industrial equipment under the <strong>VECTOMEC™</strong> line — systems that
          reflect not just where the industry is today, but where it needs to go. Our
          commitment is to continue evolving with our customers, delivering solutions that
          move their operations — and the industries we serve — forward with confidence.
        </p>

      </div><!-- /founder-left -->

      <!-- RIGHT: photo top + quote bottom, stacked in same column -->
      <div class="founder-right">

        <!-- Photo card -->
        <div class="founder-photo-card reveal">
          <img
            src="/images/team/founder-kr-subramanian.png"
            alt="K. R. Subramanian, Founder & Managing Director, Jayveecons Group"
            class="founder-img"
            width="480"
            height="540"
          >
          <div class="founder-namecard">
            <div class="namecard-name">K.&thinsp;R. Subramanian</div>
            <div class="namecard-role">Founder &amp; Managing Director</div>
            <div class="namecard-co">Jayveecons Group · Est. 1987</div>
          </div>
        </div><!-- /founder-photo-card -->

        <!-- Credential badge -->
        <div class="founder-badge reveal">
          <span class="badge-intro">Founding year</span>
          <span class="badge-product">1987 · Bengaluru, Karnataka</span>
        </div>

        <!-- Quote card -->
        <div class="founder-quote reveal" role="blockquote">
          <div class="quote-mark" aria-hidden="true">"</div>
          <p>
            At Jayveecons, Moving your world ahead is not a statement — it is a
            responsibility. Our role is to deliver engineering solutions that are not only
            cost-effective, but fundamentally reliable, efficient, and continuously
            improving through technology.
          </p>
          <cite>— Jayveecons Company Mission</cite>
        </div>

      </div><!-- /founder-right -->
    </div><!-- /founder-top -->

    <!-- ══ PROCESS CARDS — full 1440px, 4-col ══ -->
    <div class="proc-grid">

      <div class="proc-card reveal">
        <svg class="proc-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" aria-hidden="true">
          <path d="M2 3h6a4 4 0 014 4v14a3 3 0 00-3-3H2z"/>
          <path d="M22 3h-6a4 4 0 00-4 4v14a3 3 0 013-3h7z"/>
        </svg>
        <div class="proc-phase">Phase 01</div>
        <div class="proc-title">Concept &amp; Engineering Design</div>
        <p class="proc-desc">Every project starts with your process requirements. Our engineers design to your capacity, material, and site parameters — not to a generic catalogue spec.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="proc-card reveal">
        <svg class="proc-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" aria-hidden="true">
          <path d="M14.7 6.3a1 1 0 000 1.4l1.6 1.6a1 1 0 001.4 0l3.77-3.77a6 6 0 01-7.94 7.94l-6.91 6.91a2.12 2.12 0 01-3-3l6.91-6.91a6 6 0 017.94-7.94l-3.76 3.76z"/>
        </svg>
        <div class="proc-phase">Phase 02</div>
        <div class="proc-title">In-House Fabrication</div>
        <p class="proc-desc">90,000&thinsp;sq.ft of machining and fabrication capability. We manufacture to our own drawings, under our own quality control. Nothing critical is subcontracted.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="proc-card reveal">
        <svg class="proc-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" aria-hidden="true">
          <rect x="2" y="3" width="20" height="14" rx="2"/>
          <path d="M8 21h8M12 17v4"/>
        </svg>
        <div class="proc-phase">Phase 03</div>
        <div class="proc-title">Erection &amp; Commissioning</div>
        <p class="proc-desc">Our teams install and commission at your site — ensuring the equipment that leaves our floor arrives performing to specification in the field.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="proc-card reveal">
        <svg class="proc-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" aria-hidden="true">
          <path d="M12 22s8-4 8-10V5l-8-3-8 3v7c0 6 8 10 8 10z"/>
        </svg>
        <div class="proc-phase">Phase 04</div>
        <div class="proc-title">Parts, Spares &amp; After-Sales</div>
        <p class="proc-desc">Because we manufacture the equipment, we stock the parts. Long-term support backed by the same team that built your machine.</p>
      </div>

    </div><!-- /proc-grid -->

    <!-- ══ PARTNER STRIP — full width ══ -->
    <div class="partner-strip reveal">
      <span class="partner-label">Manufacturing partner</span>
      <a href="https://akshayvipra.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
        AkshayVipra El-Mec Pvt. Ltd. ↗
      </a>
    </div>

  </div><!-- /founder-inner -->
</section>

<style>
  /* ══ SECTION SHELL ══ */
  .founder-section {
    background-color: #f8fafc;
    background-image:
      linear-gradient(rgba(8,56,146,.06) 1px, transparent 1px),
      linear-gradient(90deg, rgba(8,56,146,.06) 1px, transparent 1px);
    background-size: 60px 60px;
    border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(8,56,146,.08);
    padding-block: clamp(48px, 7vh, 88px);
    position: relative;
    z-index: 1;
    isolation: isolate;
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  .founder-inner {
    max-width: 1440px;
    width: 100%;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 0 clamp(16px, 4vw, 48px);
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: clamp(20px, 3vh, 32px);
  }

  /* ══ TOP GRID ══ */
  .founder-top {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    gap: clamp(20px, 3vw, 40px);
    align-items: start;
  }
  @media (min-width: 900px) {
    .founder-top { grid-template-columns: 55fr 45fr; align-items: stretch; }
  }

  /* ── Left copy column ── */
  .founder-left { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 0; }

  .section-tag { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px; margin-bottom: 8px; }
  .tag-line { width: 28px; height: 2px; background: #c0181e; flex-shrink: 0; }
  .section-tag span { font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: 12px; letter-spacing: .2em; text-transform: uppercase; color: #c0181e; }

  .section-headline { font-family: var(--font-head); font-weight: 800; font-size: clamp(32px, 4vw, 56px); text-transform: uppercase; line-height: .97; color: rgba(8,56,146,.9); margin-bottom: 20px; }
  .accent { color: #c0181e; }

  .section-lead { font-size: clamp(13px, 1.4vw, 16px); font-weight: 400; color: #2a3550; line-height: 1.8; margin-bottom: 14px; }
  .section-lead:last-child { margin-bottom: 0; }
  .section-lead strong { color: rgba(8,56,146,.9); font-weight: 600; }

  /* ── Right column ── */
  .founder-right { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: clamp(12px, 1.5vh, 16px); }

  /* ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
     PHOTO CARD — Option E gradient · metallic sheen
  ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════ */
  .founder-photo-card {
    position: relative;                /* needed for ::before sheen */
    border-radius: 12px;
    border-top: 3px solid #c0181e;
    box-shadow:
      0 8px 28px rgba(0,0,0,.20),
      0 2px  6px rgba(0,0,0,.12),
      inset 0 1px 0 rgba(192,24,30,.18);
    overflow: hidden;
    flex: 1;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    /* Option E gradient */
    background:
      radial-gradient(ellipse 100% 60% at 20% -10%, rgba(140,180,255,.14) 0%, transparent 55%),
      radial-gradient(ellipse 60%  80% at 90% 110%, rgba(8,56,146,.25) 0%, transparent 55%),
      linear-gradient(145deg, #0e2454 0%, #163060 50%, #1a3875 100%);
  }
  /* Metallic sheen strip */
  .founder-photo-card::before {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    top: 0; left: 0; right: 0;
    height: 1px;
    background: linear-gradient(
      90deg,
      transparent 0%,
      rgba(180,210,255,.35) 25%,
      rgba(200,225,255,.55) 50%,
      rgba(180,210,255,.35) 75%,
      transparent 100%
    );
    z-index: 2;
    pointer-events: none;
  }

  .founder-img { width: 100%; flex: 1; object-fit: cover; object-position: center top; display: block; min-height: 240px; position: relative; z-index: 1; }

  .founder-namecard { padding: 14px 18px; flex-shrink: 0; position: relative; z-index: 1; }
  .namecard-name { font-family: var(--font-head); font-weight: 700; font-size: clamp(15px, 1.6vw, 19px); text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: .04em; color: #ffffff; margin-bottom: 2px; }
  .namecard-role { font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: 10px; letter-spacing: .14em; text-transform: uppercase; color: #ff7070; margin-bottom: 3px; }
  .namecard-co { font-size: 12px; font-weight: 300; color: #8898b0; }

  /* ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
     QUOTE CARD — Option E gradient · metallic sheen
  ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════ */
  .founder-quote {
    position: relative;
    border-radius: 12px;
    border-left: 4px solid #c0181e;
    box-shadow:
      0 8px 28px rgba(0,0,0,.20),
      inset 0 1px 0 rgba(192,24,30,.18);
    padding: clamp(16px, 2vw, 24px);
    flex-shrink: 0;
    /* Option E gradient */
    background:
      radial-gradient(ellipse 100% 60% at 20% -10%, rgba(140,180,255,.14) 0%, transparent 55%),
      radial-gradient(ellipse 60%  80% at 90% 110%, rgba(8,56,146,.25) 0%, transparent 55%),
      linear-gradient(145deg, #0e2454 0%, #163060 50%, #1a3875 100%);
  }
  .founder-quote::before {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    top: 0; left: 0; right: 0;
    height: 1px;
    background: linear-gradient(
      90deg,
      transparent 0%,
      rgba(180,210,255,.35) 25%,
      rgba(200,225,255,.55) 50%,
      rgba(180,210,255,.35) 75%,
      transparent 100%
    );
    z-index: 1;
    pointer-events: none;
  }

  .quote-mark { font-family: Georgia, serif; font-size: 72px; line-height: .7; color: rgba(192,24,30,.2); position: absolute; top: 14px; left: 18px; pointer-events: none; user-select: none; z-index: 0; }
  .founder-quote p { font-size: clamp(13px, 1.4vw, 15px); font-style: italic; font-weight: 300; color: #e2ecf8; line-height: 1.65; margin: 0 0 10px; padding-left: 32px; position: relative; z-index: 1; }
  .founder-quote cite { display: block; padding-left: 32px; font-size: 10px; font-family: var(--font-mono); letter-spacing: .12em; text-transform: uppercase; color: #ff7070; font-style: normal; position: relative; z-index: 1; }

  /* Credential badge */
  .founder-badge { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 3px; background: #c0181e; border-left: 4px solid #8c1014; padding: 10px 14px; border-radius: 8px; flex-shrink: 0; }
  .badge-intro { font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: 11px; letter-spacing: .18em; text-transform: uppercase; color: rgba(255,255,255,.75); }
  .badge-product { font-family: var(--font-head); font-weight: 700; font-size: clamp(13px, 1.4vw, 16px); letter-spacing: .05em; color: #fff; text-transform: uppercase; line-height: 1.2; }

  /* ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
     PROCESS CARDS — Option E gradient · E-3 typography
  ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════ */
  .proc-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 10px; }
  @media (min-width: 480px) { .proc-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; } }
  @media (min-width: 900px) { .proc-grid { grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr); } }

  .proc-card {
    position: relative;              /* required for ::before */
    border-radius: 12px;
    border-top: 3px solid transparent;
    overflow: hidden;
    padding: clamp(16px, 2vw, 24px);
    transition: border-top-color .3s, box-shadow .3s;
    /* Option E gradient + radial light */
    background:
      radial-gradient(ellipse 100% 60% at 20% -10%, rgba(140,180,255,.14) 0%, transparent 55%),
      radial-gradient(ellipse 60%  80% at 90% 110%, rgba(8,56,146,.25) 0%, transparent 55%),
      linear-gradient(145deg, #0e2454 0%, #163060 50%, #1a3875 100%);
    box-shadow:
      0 8px 28px rgba(0,0,0,.20),
      0 2px  6px rgba(0,0,0,.12),
      inset 0 1px 0 rgba(192,24,30,.10);
  }
  /* Metallic sheen */
  .proc-card::before {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    top: 0; left: 0; right: 0;
    height: 1px;
    background: linear-gradient(
      90deg,
      transparent 0%,
      rgba(180,210,255,.35) 25%,
      rgba(200,225,255,.55) 50%,
      rgba(180,210,255,.35) 75%,
      transparent 100%
    );
    z-index: 1;
    pointer-events: none;
  }
  .proc-card:hover {
    border-top-color: #c0181e;
    box-shadow:
      0 14px 36px rgba(0,0,0,.26),
      0 4px  10px rgba(0,0,0,.14),
      inset 0 1px 0 rgba(192,24,30,.25);
  }

  .proc-icon { width: 20px; height: 20px; color: #e02428; margin-bottom: 8px; opacity: .9; display: block; position: relative; z-index: 2; }

  .proc-phase {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 10px;
    letter-spacing: .14em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: #e02428;
    margin-bottom: 5px;
    opacity: .85;
    position: relative; z-index: 2;
  }

  /* Title — E-3: #ffffff · 700 */
  .proc-title {
    font-family: var(--font-head);
    font-weight: 700;
    font-size: clamp(14px, 1.5vw, 17px);
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: .03em;
    color: #ffffff;
    margin-bottom: 8px;
    line-height: 1.1;
    position: relative; z-index: 2;
  }

  /* Description — E-3: #e2ecf8 · 14px · 300 */
  .proc-desc {
    font-family: var(--font-body);
    font-size: 14px;
    font-weight: 300;
    color: #e2ecf8;
    line-height: 1.7;
    margin: 0;
    position: relative; z-index: 2;
  }

  /* ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
     PARTNER STRIP — Option E gradient
  ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════ */
  .partner-strip {
    position: relative;
    border-radius: 8px;
    border-left: 4px solid #c0181e;
    box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(0,0,0,.12);
    padding: 14px 20px;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-between;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 10px;
    overflow: hidden;
    background:
      radial-gradient(ellipse 100% 60% at 20% -10%, rgba(140,180,255,.10) 0%, transparent 55%),
      linear-gradient(145deg, #0e2454 0%, #163060 50%, #1a3875 100%);
  }
  .partner-strip::before {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    top: 0; left: 0; right: 0;
    height: 1px;
    background: linear-gradient(90deg, transparent 0%, rgba(200,225,255,.45) 50%, transparent 100%);
    pointer-events: none;
  }
  .partner-label { font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: 11px; letter-spacing: .14em; text-transform: uppercase; color: #e2ecf8; font-weight: 300; position: relative; z-index: 1; }
  .partner-strip a { font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: 11px; letter-spacing: .12em; color: var(--teal-l, #14a898); text-decoration: none; text-transform: uppercase; transition: color .2s; position: relative; z-index: 1; }
  .partner-strip a:hover { color: #ffffff; }

  /* ── Reveal ── */
  .reveal { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(22px); transition: opacity .65s ease, transform .65s ease; }
  .reveal.visible { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0); }
  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) { .reveal { opacity: 1; transform: none; transition: none; } }
</style>